<title>CHINA: BZW sets warrants on basket of Thailand stocks.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on basket of Thailand stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Monday it has launched four million American style composite call warrants on a basket of Thailand stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Bangkok Bank Foreign	 2 shares</p>
<p> Krung Thai Foreign	   5 shares</p>
<p> Thai Farmers Bank F	  2 shares</p>
<p> Siam Cement F		  0.5 shares</p>
<p> PTT Exp &amp; Prod - F	   1 share</p>
<p> Telecom Asia - F	     7 shares</p>
<p> Siam Comm Bank F	     1 share</p>
<p> Advanced Info F		1 share</p>
<p> United Comm F		  1 share</p>
<p> IFCT F			   2 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$89.61     PREMIUM	 26.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$2.348     GEARING	 3.82x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 07.JUL.97    LISTING DATE  28.JUL.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  07.JUL.98    PAYDATE	 28.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG   MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    US$89.61</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
